{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415767","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415767","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1041576701:1":{"text":"ちょっと、ラメンティス！僕が念入りに準備した最高の舞台に、なんてことをしてくれたんだ！","source_cn":"拉曼提斯！那座小城可是我精心准备了整整半个月的绝佳剧场！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A78F4633053C8FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041576702:1":{"text":"ああ、僕の美しき芸術品！血と汗の結晶！すっごく楽しみにしてたのに、よくも台無しにしてくれたな！","source_cn":"是我的艺术品！我的心血！我快乐的源泉！现在全都被你毁了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CA4E91E3BE42528","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041576703:1":{"text":"半月もかけて町への物資補給を断ち切って、使者に化けて、ブライトは君たちを見捨てたっていう偽情報を流して……","source_cn":"我花了整整半个月的时间切断了城市的物资补给，又伪装成信...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C6F817ED0D538C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041576704:1":{"text":"それから毎晩、あいつらの影にひそひそ囁かせて、兵士たちの疑念と恐怖を少しずつ膨らませていって……","source_cn":"接着，我每天晚上让他们的影子对着他们窃窃私语，放大每一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE229AF1A1DB0C5F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041576705:1":{"text":"ようやく指揮官が正気を失って、一番信頼していた副官に斬りかかり、兵士たちが僕の残したわずかな物資を奪い合って殺し合いを始め――","source_cn":"就在他们的指挥官精神失常，要拿刀砍向他最信任的副官，士...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C99BCAD75081C4A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041576706:1":{"text":"絶望の極限まで追い詰められ、人間性が完全に崩れ落ちる――あの甘ぁい悲鳴が、今にも響き渡ろうとしていたのに！","source_cn":"那种被绝望逼到了极点、人性彻底崩塌的甜美惨叫声马上就要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A5AA95245A6589D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041576707:1":{"text":"なんで――町ごと爆破して更地にしちゃったんだよぉ！","source_cn":"你——竟然把整座城市都炸平了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x765B7301C4CA7C2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041576708:1":{"text":"ちっ……うるせぇな。","source_cn":"啧……吵死了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1F760CA7AD80444","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041576709:1":{"text":"おめぇがチンタラしてるせいだろ。退屈すぎて、頭が痛くなったんだよ。","source_cn":"太慢了，太无聊了，看得小爷脑子疼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D2B8DC73D8441A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041576710:1":{"text":"君は演出というものを分かっていない！完璧なお膳立てだったのにぃ！","source_cn":"这叫戏剧的张力！这叫完美的铺垫！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63E5269C240412B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041576711:1":{"text":"正義を気取る人間たちが、疑い合いながら自分の手で仲間の胸に刃を突き立てる――そんな光景の方が、爆発なんかより一万倍芸術的だと思わないのかい？","source_cn":"看着自诩正义的人类在猜忌中亲手把刀刺进同伴的胸膛，这难...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46D31728CAFAA652","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041576712:1":{"text":"思わねぇな。","source_cn":"不觉得。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A742831BCF8D72D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041576713:1":{"text":"あいつらがぐずぐずしてるから、俺様が手を貸してやったんだ。まとめて灰にしてやったほうが手っ取り早いだろうが。","source_cn":"既然他们磨磨唧唧的，小爷我就帮他们一把，直接让他们一起...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75A2B5EB00D4B6FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041576714:1":{"text":"やれやれ……なんて品のない幕引なんだ。","source_cn":"哇哦……真是一场毫无品味的谢幕。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x155F03B6EE22C71B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041576715:1":{"text":"これ以上ぐだぐだ言うなら、次に灰になるのはおめぇだぞ。","source_cn":"再废话，下一个变成灰的就是你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x744F25CAA8B24866","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041576716:1":{"text":"この世界で一番予測不能な混沌は、やっぱり君のその、論理の欠片もない頭の中だねぇ！","source_cn":"看来在这个世界上，最不可预测的混沌，永远是你那颗毫无逻...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D46B8D914F47876","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041576717:1":{"text":"僕は次の舞台を探しに行くよ。君は絶対についてくるんじゃないぞ！","source_cn":"我得去找下一个舞台了，你可别跟过来哦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D09B8F68699CA40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:贝利尔":{"text":"ベリル","source":"贝利尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:拉曼提斯":{"text":"ラメンティス","source":"拉曼提斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":18,"localized_text_count":17,"speaker_count":2}}